3.Pick any app you use daily (like Zomato, Instagram, or Flipkart) and write a short feature request as if you were the product manager.
Then, briefly describe which team members (designer, backend, mobile developer, tester) would be involved in delivering this feature and what each would do.

Flipkart Feature Request: “Buy Again” Button

Feature Request:
As a Product Manager, I want to add a “Buy Again” button to Flipkart so users can quickly reorder products they have purchased before.

Team Members Involved
Team Member	What they would do
Designer	Design the “Buy Again” button and the screen layout.
Backend/API Developer	Create APIs to fetch the user's previous orders and product details.
Mobile Developer	Add the “Buy Again” feature to the Flipkart mobile app.
Tester/QA	Test the feature, check for bugs, and make sure reordering works correctly.

Final result: The user can open their previous orders, tap “Buy Again,” and quickly reorder the product.
